  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Aurora Fantasy\"></p>\n<p>Aurora Fantasy 是一款 Minecraft 著色器包，旨在將您的世界轉化為充滿魔幻、夢幻及電影氛圍的場景。它著重於鮮豔的奇幻光效、發光的夜間螢火蟲、豐富的色彩，以及包含極光（北極光）的迷人夜空。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"What&#x27;s New in Version 5.4\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>錯誤修復與<span style=\"color:#f92aff\">相容性</span></strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>玩家在水下能見度</strong></span>: 修復了在 Minecraft 26.2 版本中，其他玩家視角下玩家在水下不可見的錯誤。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>The End 中的遠地平線</strong></span>: 修復了在 Minecraft 26.2 中使用 Distant Horizons 模組時，在地獄維度中著色器無法正常運作的問題。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>夜間能見度與降雨</strong></span>: 改善了夜間能見度並修復了夜晚降雨顯示的問題。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>降雨期間的極光</strong></span>: 修復了夜晚降雨時極天空效果仍然可見的故障。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>功能與改進</strong></span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>發光夜間螢火蟲</strong></span>: 魔法螢火蟲在夜晚照亮環境（設置中可選擇禁用）。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>雨滴積水</strong></span>: 重新設計了雨滴積水以提高視覺質量，並提供了完全禁用選項。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>增強的雨天氣氛</strong></span>: 改進了雨滴視覺效果以及白天和夜晚雨天的大氣效果。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>新太陽與月亮</strong></span>: 完全重新設計的太陽和月亮，以實現更好的奇幻風格。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>簡化配置文件</strong></span>: 將圖形設置簡化為兩個主要配置文件：平衡模式和極限模式。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>常規優化</strong></span>: 各種性能優化和小錯誤修復。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Media\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph1\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph2\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/3.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph3\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/4.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph4\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/5.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph5\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/6.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph6\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/7.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph7\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/8.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph8\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/9.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph9\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/10.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph10\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/11.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph11\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/12.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph12\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/13.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph13\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/14.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph14\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/15.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph15\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/16.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph16\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/17.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph17\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/18.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph18\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/19.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph19\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/20.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph20\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/21.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph21\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/22.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph22\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/23.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph23\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/24.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph24\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/25.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph25\"><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Picture/26.png?raw=true\" alt=\"ph26\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/4.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Key Features\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>空靈夜晚與螢火蟲</strong></span>: 極光（北極光）、逼真的星空中魔法發光螢火蟲，轉變夜空景象。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>大氣雲層</strong></span>: 動態雲層和柔和霧氣為地平線增加深度和生機。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>流動的水與精緻降雨</strong></span>: 逼真的海浪、清晰的水面反射、清澈的雨滴和動態雨積水。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>現代反射</strong></span>: 對水面和濕潤表面應用高品質屏幕空間反射（SSR），實現精緻的視覺風格。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>沉浸式天氣</strong></span>: 在沙漠生物群系中的雨天中實現逼真的灰塵和沙暴。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>卓越的表現</strong></span>: 設計用於在多種硬件配置上高效運行。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>超遠距離支援</strong></span>: 與大規模渲染模組如遠地平線兼容（可在著色器設置中切換）。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>簡化圖形配置文件</strong></span>: 快速選擇平衡模式或極限模式的預設。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/5.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Technical Requirements &amp; Performance\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>平衡配置文件</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>Minecraft 26.1.2 及更早版本：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1050（或等效顯卡）:</span>: 顯著更流暢，提供每秒 40 到 60 FPS（平均約 50 FPS）。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>Minecraft 26.2（要求更高）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1050（或等效顯卡）:</span>: 平均每約 30 到 40 FPS。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1660（或等效顯卡）:</span>: 平均每約 40 FPS。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>極限配置文件</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#f92aff\"><strong>Minecraft 26.2（要求更高）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">NVIDIA GTX 1660（或等效顯卡）:</span>: 平均每約 35 FPS。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">(<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">注意</span>: 推薦使用高端顯卡在極限配置文件中於 Minecraft 26.2 下達到 60 FPS)。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/6.1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support the Project💖\"></p>\n<p>如果您喜歡<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>&nbsp;Aurora Fantasy</strong></span>&nbsp;並希望支持其開發，可以在 Patrean 上留下小費。</p>\n<p><em>(這是完全自願的支持，一切對所有人都是免費的！)</em></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/in2bubble/membership\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrean 支援</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy-Media/blob/main/Banner/6.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Credits &amp; License\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKDXavier\" rel=\"nofollow\">KDXavier</a></strong></span>: 原始創作者&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fmakeup-ultra-fast-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUp - Ultra Fast</a></span>&nbsp;著色器</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fin2bubble\" rel=\"nofollow\">in2bubble</a></span></strong>: Aurora Fantasy&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252faurora-fantasy\" rel=\"nofollow\">著色器修改</a></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fEntokito\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entokito</a></span></strong>: 額外著色器代碼（使用 LGPL v3.0）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/kosua20\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simon Rodriguez</a></strong></span>: FXAA 3.11 抗鋸齒演算法</p>\n<p><strong>授權</strong>: GNU 廣源公共授權版本 3.0 (LGPL v3.0)</p>\n<p><strong>原始 GitHub（未修改的分叉）:</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/MakeUpUltraFast\" rel=\"nofollow\">MakeUpUltraFast</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>修改後的 GitHub 倉庫:</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/in2bubble/Aurora-Fantasy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aurora-Fantasy</a></span></p>\n<p><strong>支援與問題報告：</strong>請直接在 CurseForge&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/aurora-fantasy/comments\" rel=\"nofollow\">評論區</a></span> 報告任何問題或留下您的反饋。</p>",
